        "text": "Security update for transfig",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for transfig fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2025-31164: Fixed heap-buffer overflow in fig2dev create_line_with_spline() function (bsc#1240379)\n- CVE-2025-31162: Fixed floating point exception in fig2dev get_slope() function (bsc#1240380)\n- CVE-2025-31163: Fixed segmentation fault in fig2dev put_patternarc() function (bsc#1240381)\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
